SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:06:18 and reappears at 17:52:22 IST\, se
 en from Bhuj.\nThe Moon is 41° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +24°.\nTim
 es against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's 
 edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Bhuj
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Bhuj
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
